    "claim_boundary": "This proves an all-length rank upper bound for the pinned minimum-genus free 3x3 tube family and audits the same local gauge identity for periodic and antiperiodic conventions. It does not prove a growing-width bound h(w), a cubic-box compression, or any thermodynamic singularity.",
